SUBSECTION:: Hierarchical event density
code::
Pbranching(0, { |n| if(n[\depth] < 2) { 3 } { 1 } }, maxDepth: 3).collect { |n|
    (degree: n[\value], dur: 0.25 / (n[\depth] + 1))
}.asStream.all;
::

Tree values choose pitch/position; deeper descendants arrive faster. Uses the instruments in link::Guides/Patternarium#Example instruments::.
